.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.env
# data/ is excluded wholesale EXCEPT data/macro/*.parquet, which the
# predictor image bakes in as a fallback so the gold/macro dashboard
# panel works even before the docker-compose bind-mount is populated
# or if live Yahoo Finance fetches are blocked on a given network.
# Mirrors the same carve-out in .gitignore.
data/*
!data/macro/
data/macro/*
!data/macro/*.parquet
logs/
*.egg-info
.git
Testing/
outputs/
